{"availability":"available","full":"atopos31/llmio","name":"llmio","description":"Unified LLM gateway with weighted load balancing, observability & cost tracking. 统一的 LLM 网关，提供权重负载均衡、可观测性与费用追踪。","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":318,"forks":42,"created":"2025-08-06T03:43:36Z","updated":"2026-10-06T10:08:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["ai","ai-gateway","claude","claude-ai","claude-code","codex","deepseek","doubao","gemini","gemini-cli","go","golang","kimi","newapi","openai","openclaw","qwen","transformer"],"demo":"https://llmio-rust.vercel.app/**","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.121Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.121Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.121Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.121Z","stars":318,"forks":42}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["LLMIO is a Go-based LLM load‑balancing gateway that provides a unified REST API, weighted scheduling, observability, and a modern admin UI for LLM clients (openclaw / claude code / codex / gemini cli / cherry studio / open webui). It helps you integrate OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and other model capabilities in a single service."],"features":["Unified API: Compatible with OpenAI Chat Completions, OpenAI Responses, Gemini Native, and Anthropic Messages. Supports both streaming and non‑streaming passthrough.","Protocol bridge: When the client protocol differs from the upstream protocol, requests are translated automatically (OpenAI ⇄ Anthropic, streaming events included). Anything that cannot be carried across is either…","Custom headers & session keys: Each model–provider association can carry headers with {{...}} placeholders, and a session key is derived in stages from the request body, an inbound session header or a conversation root…","Weighted scheduling: balancers/ provides two strategies (random by weight / priority by weight). You can route based on tool calling, structured output, and multimodal capability.","Admin Web UI: React + TypeScript + Tailwind + Vite console covering the dashboard, analytics, quick start, providers, model routing, request logs, session comparison, quota, auth keys, and system configuration."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"83134a593c572571518cf588cb34485b16304beaa68da87b02c730248a672fd2","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.295Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.295Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"LLMIO is a Go-based LLM load‑balancing gateway that provides a unified REST API, weighted scheduling, observability, and a modern admin UI for LLM clients (openclaw / claude code / codex / gemini cli / cherry studio / open webui). It helps you integrate OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and other model capabilities in a single service.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"TokenPlan, login-based), opencode (plan, login-based) and custom (a generic endpoint whose path you supply, read through itemsPath plus a field mapping).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Login-based adapters need their credentials in the source's own env (keys SCNETUSER / SCNETPASS and OPENCODECOOKIE / OPENCODEORGID): those upstreams require a real login and session, which a script cannot reproduce, so they live in Go.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"upstream by default and needs no external credentials; --upstream opencode runs a smaller matrix against a real upstream (consuming quota). e2e/checkcompression.py does not trust what the API reports about itself — it opens the database file and checks that the compressed form and autovacuum really landed on disk. e2e/checkvacuum.py measures what a rebuild costs concurrent…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"83134a593c572571518cf588cb34485b16304beaa68da87b02c730248a672fd2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.295Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T10:08:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atopos31/llmio/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:45.297Z","hash":"83134a593c572571518cf588cb34485b16304beaa68da87b02c730248a672fd2","originalBytes":35567,"storedBytes":35567,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","database","request","token","anthropic","session","model","post","one","compression","logs","openai","reclamation","run","bearer","quota","docs","only","provider","vacuum","when","migration","per","protocol","rows","batch","default","llmio","same","body","get","space","write","client","every","gemini","source","bash","models","never","upstream","auth","auto","console","endpoints","headers","key","page","required","compressed","runs","seconds","disk","each","file","log","policy","rebuild","single","stored","time","upstreams","cannot","free","gib","header","interval","mode","usage","x-api-key","available","balance","bodies","custom","full","incremental","needs","pages","requests","see","size","test","two","window","written","about","admin","any","back","between","chat","check","create","data","once","own","path","pause","returns","round","service","set","tokens","under","value","what","while","authorization","background","batches","before","both","cache","code","config","configuration","content","credentials","current","different","does","generic","keys","last","list","live","message","opencode","output","put","range","reclaim","refresh","response","starts","status","text","values","which","whole","writes","after","analytics","bytes","chunk","columns","compat","conversation","count","description","e2e","either","enab